synthsr
Copyright 2026 Neurodesk contributors

Native port of the SynthSR web application's spatial preprocessing,
postprocessing and inference contract (packages/synthsr, Apache-2.0), itself
derived from https://github.com/neurolabusc/py_synthsr
(commit 04ab5548f4609c2b44ca51b3f4bc319b585dafa7) and
https://github.com/BBillot/SynthSR. Model checkpoint: synthsr_v20_230130.h5,
converted to ONNX without retraining.

Iglesias JE, Billot B, Balbastre Y, et al. (2021). Joint super-resolution and
synthesis of 1 mm isotropic MP-RAGE volumes from clinical MRI exams with scans
of different orientation, resolution and contrast. NeuroImage 237:118206.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2021.118206

